for-GA.\n52\t- Re-verify each remediated gap against its assessment evidence to confirm\n53\t  closure.\n54\t- Keep the existing Konflux build pipeline green for all changes in the\n55\t  Llama Stack midstream repo.\n56\t\n57\tThe concrete work items in this epic are defined by the assessment outcome;\n58\tthe epic exists so that assessment-found remediation has a planned home\n59\trather than being discovered late.\n60\t\n61\t## Acceptance Criteria\n62\t\n63\t- Every gap classified as must-fix-for-GA by the GA-readiness assessment\n64\t  (outside API stability, which is handled by the API stability guarantee\n65\t  work) is remediated or explicitly re-classified with recorded justification.\n66\t- Each remediation is verified against the evidence that originally recorded\n67\t  the gap.\n68\t- The Konflux build pipeline for the Llama Stack midstream repo is green with\n69\t  these changes.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-1 (P0, partial): closing the gaps inventoried by the GA-readiness\n74\t  assessment — the assessment defines the scope, this epic delivers the\n75\t  remediation.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf6e1d0d1832fc50","agent_id":"a69dc72ccb749c3c1","session_id":"24dada96-80a8-453c-92a4-331603e90011","uuid":"ae65bee1-55e2-412e-8427-c69e398b3a51","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:02:28.907Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3c3d03ab2302211","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
