plement and test an upgrade path from the last two TP releases to the GA\n52\t  release, including migration of existing LlamaStackDistribution resources.\n53\t- Stabilize the specific API behaviors flagged as GA-blocking by the\n54\t  GA-readiness assessment.\n55\t- Keep the existing Konflux build pipeline green for all changes in the\n56\t  Llama Stack midstream repo.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- Published APIs are versioned, and the versioning scheme is documented.\n61\t- A deprecation policy is published and covers signaling, support windows for\n62\t  deprecated surfaces, and upgrade obligations.\n63\t- An upgrade from each of the last two TP releases to the GA release is\n64\t  exercised by automated tests, with documented migration steps for any\n65\t  breaking change.\n66\t- API behaviors identified as GA-blocking by the GA-readiness assessment are\n67\t  stabilized or explicitly covered by the deprecation policy.\n68\t- The Konflux build pipeline for the Llama Stack midstream repo is green with\n69\t  these changes.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-2 (P0): Published API surface carries a stability guarantee — versioned\n74\t  APIs, deprecation policy, and a tested upgrade path from the last two TP\n75\t  releases.\n76\t- HLR-1 (P0, partial): stabilization targets are the API-stability gaps\n77\t  inventoried by the GA-readiness assessment.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-af78e6c4207965dd","agent_id":"a16633f84a5744f38","session_id":"24dada96-80a8-453c-92a4-331603e90011","uuid":"5fa44a22-0619-4ebc-a0c5-feedcf9ccce3","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:11:07.512Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bfc1d777e3d84cc1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
