ath alignment with the\n51\t  production support posture.\n52\t- Produce the TrustyAI-side validation findings and support sign-off as the\n53\t  deliverable that backs the \"supported integration\" claim.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- TrustyAI guardrails are validated working against Llama Stack GA\n58\t  distribution configurations, with results recorded.\n59\t- Compatibility with the supported TrustyAI configurations is confirmed and\n60\t  documented.\n61\t- TrustyAI team support sign-off for the integration is recorded, including\n62\t  any known limitations.\n63\t- Validation findings are handed off to the GA documentation uplift so the\n64\t  documented integration reflects verified behavior.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-4 (P1): Safety guardrails via TrustyAI are a supported, documented\n69\t  integration for GA distributions — this epic provides the TrustyAI-side\n70\t  validation and support commitment behind that guarantee.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-af78e6c4207965dd","agent_id":"a16633f84a5744f38","session_id":"24dada96-80a8-453c-92a4-331603e90011","uuid":"bbca14f6-2145-4747-987b-1f654946b2db","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:11:14.392Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-85559d4b466b1b63","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
